## Regression: an INLINE `(small_int as UInt32) << N` term must contribute the
## widened, shifted value. The cast must materialise a 32-bit value so the
## enclosing `<<` does not run at the source (8-bit) width and mask the shift
## amount. The packed result must be 0xFF010203 (4278256131).
def main
  let x = (255u8 as UInt32) << 24 | ((1u8 as UInt32) << 16) | ((2u8 as UInt32) << 8) | (3u8 as UInt32)
  puts "#{x}"
end
